      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make puffs.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake a pint of Cheese Curds and drain them dry, bruise them small with the hand, put in two handfulls of floure, a little Sugar, three or four yolks of Egs, a little Nutmeg and Salt, mingle these together and make them little, like eyes, fry them in fresh butter, serve them up with fresh Butter and Sugar.\u003Cbr\u003E"
